# 🔟 Longest Bitonic Subsequence

## Definition

First:

```text
Increasing
```

Then:

```text
Decreasing
```

---

### Example

```text
1 4 3 2
```

Bitonic Length:

```text
4
```

---

# 1️⃣1️⃣ Idea

Compute:

### LIS from Left

```cpp
lis[i]
```

---

### LIS from Right

```cpp
lds[i]
```

(Longest Decreasing Subsequence)

---

### Formula

```cpp
answer
=
lis[i]
+
lds[i]
-
1
```

Take maximum.

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N²)
```

---

# 1️⃣2️⃣ Number of LIS

## Problem

Count total LIS.

---

### Example

```text
1 3 5 4 7
```

LIS Length:

```text
4
```

