```

---

# 1️⃣3️⃣ Additional Array

Maintain:

```cpp
length[i]
```

and

```cpp
count[i]
```

---

### If Longer Found

```cpp
length[i]
=
1 + length[prev];

count[i]
=
count[prev];
```

---

### If Same Length Found

```cpp
count[i]
+=
count[prev];
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N²)
```

