# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ LIS is one of the most important DP topics.

✅ Learn O(N²) and O(N log N) versions.

✅ Bitonic = LIS + LDS.

✅ Divisible Subset = Modified LIS.

✅ String Chain = LIS on Strings.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using Binary Search version when sequence reconstruction is needed.

❌ Forgetting sorting in Divisible Subset.

❌ Wrong Bitonic formula.

❌ Missing count updates in Number of LIS.

❌ Confusing subsequence with subarray.

